  1053	    budget_seconds: float = 0.5,
  1054	    normalize_unicode: bool = True,
  1055	) -> Tuple[str, List[Finding]]:
  1056	    """Scan + redact the SAME text. Returns (redacted_text, findings).
  1057	
  1058	    The redacted text is ``text`` with only the merged finding spans
  1059	    replaced (see ``redact``); no normalization reaches the output.
  1060	    """
